# Every external version, commit, checksum and key fingerprint used by setup.sh.
# The only file to edit when updating. Sourced by bash; keep it to plain assignments.
# Pins resolved 2026-09-28. After changing anything: ./setup.sh --check-pins, then test.

# ---- apt repos: signing keys in keys/, fingerprints checked before use ----------------------
